    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a strong and positive relationship with mathematics, especially in economics and everyday problem-solving. It feels logical and structured, like a language I can use to understand the world. I enjoy solving equations and applying them to real-life situations, such as budgeting or analyzing trends. Math gives me clarity and confidence in decision-making.",
